flowchart LR
    A[VICIdial completed recording] --> B[Server B exporter]
    B --> C[Middleware reservation API]
    C --> D[Private object storage]
    B --> E[Middleware completion API]
    E --> F[Checksum and object verification]
    F --> G[Odoo recording upsert]
    G --> H[Middleware ODOO_LINKED state]
    H --> I[Middleware outbox]
    I -. inactive by default .-> J[n8n generic ingress]
    J -. optional .-> K[Transcription or QA]
    K -. result .-> L[Middleware automation-result]
    L -. metadata status .-> G

    R[Retention enforcement] --> D
    H --> R
